{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/3f85eb5300f24cf695c53f198fe3a968.webp?t=1770800722\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/3f85eb5300f24cf695c53f198fe3a968.poster.avif?t=1770800722\" class=\"bb_img\" width=694 height=428 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/f6808537e29877029300b6957342931e.poster.avif?t=1770800722\" width=800 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/f6808537e29877029300b6957342931e.webm?t=1770800722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/f6808537e29877029300b6957342931e.mp4?t=1770800722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/ede905e28bd91d73178e0d3985241d5b.poster.avif?t=1770800722\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/ede905e28bd91d73178e0d3985241d5b.webm?t=1770800722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/ede905e28bd91d73178e0d3985241d5b.mp4?t=1770800722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Classic-Inspired Journey, Reimagined in a Modern Metroidvania World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of Hira, a mysterious child fated to stand against ancient gods. Fallen Tear: The Ascension combines the emotional weight and party-building of classic JRPGs with the freeform exploration of Metroidvanias and just a sprinkle of roguelike challenge. Every death teaches. Every bond matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Love Letter to JRPGs\u2014Told Through a Hand-Drawn Metroidvania</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic JRPGs, explore a massive, interconnected world, presented through gorgeous hand-drawn animation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through lush forests, lost cities, and forgotten ruins\u2014all teeming with hidden pathways and challenges to conquer. Discover more than 20 biomes scattered throughout the world of Raoah\u2019s ever-changing map, which transforms in response to Hira\u2019s actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/995316fd0adee57294d109307e05366c.poster.avif?t=1770800722\" width=800 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/995316fd0adee57294d109307e05366c.webm?t=1770800722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/995316fd0adee57294d109307e05366c.mp4?t=1770800722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/d9525b2e4e4dddf8f58d02316c86465f.poster.avif?t=1770800722\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/d9525b2e4e4dddf8f58d02316c86465f.webm?t=1770800722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/d9525b2e4e4dddf8f58d02316c86465f.mp4?t=1770800722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become Raoah\u2019s Fiercest Warrior</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Slash, parry, and dodge incoming attacks from foes. Customize Hira with a wealth of combat skills and abilities while exploring all Raoah has to offer. Swap weapons and switch strategies mid-battle to keep enemies and bosses second-guessing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/fdabf75cbdae84044cc17e1fca203f11.poster.avif?t=1770800722\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/fdabf75cbdae84044cc17e1fca203f11.webm?t=1770800722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/fdabf75cbdae84044cc17e1fca203f11.mp4?t=1770800722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Form Unwavering Bonds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Forge friendships with mages, swordsmen, tricksters, and healers through the Fated Bonds system! Inspired by JRPG battle systems, recruit allies and harness their abilities in combat. Travel alongside more than 16 fully-voiced allies, each with their own abilities to experiment with and stories to unravel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelike Influence with Persistent Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every run teaches you something new\u2014map paths, enemy patterns, and hidden mechanics. But the story, character progress, and upgrades carry forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/de034bc13c8c21b181fb1eb4133e02c6.poster.avif?t=1770800722\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/de034bc13c8c21b181fb1eb4133e02c6.webm?t=1770800722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/de034bc13c8c21b181fb1eb4133e02c6.mp4?t=1770800722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stake Your Claim</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize a Castle towering above all of Raoah, filled with friendly faces met along the way. Complete minigames and acquire upgrades, while also shaping it through Hira\u2019s actions and relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/d33118b10aab05d605ed26cd1d85c8e7.poster.avif?t=1770800722\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/d33118b10aab05d605ed26cd1d85c8e7.webm?t=1770800722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/d33118b10aab05d605ed26cd1d85c8e7.mp4?t=1770800722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand-Animated 2D Art</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gorgeously drawn sprites and environments, inspired by JRPGs of the golden era, reimagined with modern indie flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ever wished Final Fantasy met Hollow Knight in a hand-painted world, this is your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1446900?t=1770800722","background_raw":"https://store