ough the Fated Bonds system! Inspired by JRPG battle systems, recruit allies and harness their abilities in combat. Travel alongside more than 16 fully-voiced allies, each with their own abilities to experiment with and stories to unravel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelike Influence with Persistent Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every run teaches you something new\u2014map paths, enemy patterns, and hidden mechanics. But the story, character progress, and upgrades carry forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/de034bc13c8c21b181fb1eb4133e02c6.poster.avif?t=1770800722\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/de034bc13c8c21b181fb1eb4133e02c6.webm?t=1770800722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/de034bc13c8c21b181fb1eb4133e02c6.mp4?t=1770800722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stake Your Claim</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize a Castle towering above all of Raoah, filled with friendly faces met along the way. Complete minigames and acquire upgrades, while also shaping it through Hira\u2019s actions and relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/d33118b10aab05d605ed26cd1d85c8e7.poster.avif?t=1770800722\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/d33118b10aab05d605ed26cd1d85c8e7.webm?t=1770800722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/extras/d33118b10aab05d605ed26cd1d85c8e7.mp4?t=1770800722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand-Animated 2D Art</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gorgeously drawn sprites and environments, inspired by JRPGs of the golden era, reimagined with modern indie flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ever wished Final Fantasy met Hollow Knight in a hand-painted world, this is your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Winter Crew Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446900/4b4fc276ac7eb591dc498db183537556557e5172/header.jpg?t=1770800722","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Fallen Tear: The Ascension \u00a9 Copyright 2020-2025 CMD Studios","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1446900/593324224/2f39136b1aef60df167549dfa95d6a1e6c9ea74e/1755872375/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766388006","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1446900/593324224/2f39136b1aef60df167549dfa95d6a1e6c9ea74e/1755872375/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766388006","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1446900/593324224/2f39136b1aef60df167549dfa95d6a1e6c9ea74e/1755872375/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766388006","id":257168893,"name":"Fallen Tear: The Ascension - Official Trailer 2025","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257168893/ca5752ca23e4465bea75d2dfc83b93dda4e96a61/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766388006"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1446900/736761078/e376506a762b2c9c34558be06af028dd597a7f7b/1754920237/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754921282","dash_h2